## Recommendation

All three round-3 findings are closed in their original scope.
Pin Close at 1280 and 640 too: viewport width does not remove the need for a visible pointer exit, and pinning only the control preserves reading space.
The wider-width finding follows from the prototype and b3’s scroll-reset step; the supplied drawer captures cover 390.
Adopt the spec reviewer’s advisories 1 and 3 as written; neither wording correction is itself a UI blocker.
